%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 22d0308a90dc49ae97395f1b651723b5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_02_ClosePlan
  questionId: COMM-02
  category: 2
  speakerName: Sales Director
  questionText: >-
    The CRO wants a close plan, but the security team says they need another month of testing. How do you avoid losing the deal or the trust?
  answerOptions:
  - {fileID: 11400001}
  - {fileID: 11400002}
  - {fileID: 11400003}
  - {fileID: 11400004}
--- !u!114 &11400001
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_02_A1
  answerText: >-
    Split technical validation from commercial approval and agree what evidence must be produced by each date.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 3
  rapportDelta: 1
  energyDelta: 1
--- !u!114 &11400002
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_02_A2
  answerText: >-
    Push for executive alignment and let the technical team continue testing in parallel.
  technicalDelta: 0
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: -1
  energyDelta: 1
--- !u!114 &11400003
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_02_A3
  answerText: >-
    Tell the CRO the team is dragging their feet and needs pressure.
  technicalDelta: -1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: -2
  energyDelta: -1
--- !u!114 &11400004
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d521c6b84db4b8fae30e3785d9e9582, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q_COMM_02_A4
  answerText: >-
    Ask the technical team what unresolved risk blocks a recommendation, then convert that into the close plan.
  technicalDelta: 1
  commercialDelta: 2
  rapportDelta: 2
  energyDelta: 1
